ted-in-lgbtq-raids/a-79251409--cfa34afe3cef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-162-arrested-in-lgbtq-raids/a-79251409?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Turkish authorities have arrested at least 162 people in a weekend crackdown on the country's LGBTQ+ community. Ankara says police raids on gay bars and other venues are aimed at protecting family values.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine, Poland say Russia hit Warsaw-bound passenger train</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d783aecbeceb6b292697dfaaac71e751baced96cf64e27149dfab958b000e1c8</id><updated>2026-09-14T05:08:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T12:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-poland-say-russia-hit-warsaw-bound-passenger-train/a-79251428--fddf046eb6b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-poland-say-russia-hit-warsaw-bound-passenger-train/a-79251428?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The strike hit a locomotive of a passenger train headed to Warsaw with reports that senior Western figures were at the station shortly before the attack.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russians on the Goethe-Institut: 'Hostage to politics'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aca4be5cfa1727d960132872050f278ce97b5c7878551aecdbe5d33769e2bf04</id><updated>2026-09-14T05:08:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T11:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russians-on-the-goethe-institut-hostage-to-politics/a-79218936--8619b68c7998.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russians-on-the-goethe-institut-hostage-to-politics/a-79218936?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Canceled language exams, disrupted plans to study in Germany and the disappearance of an important cultural link: DW users shared how the closure of Germany's Goethe-Institut in Russia has affected their lives.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Croatia: 'Monster' fire triggers evacuation on Brac island</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b02034438a82ba52af38dfa6faa9c295e1ebe9255a9c22eeca9045ab746c4477</id><updated>2026-09-14T05:08:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T10:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/croatia-monster-fire-triggers-evacuation-on-brac-island/a-79250480--68433f30b29b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/croatia-monster-fire-triggers-evacuation-on-brac-island/a-79250480?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A rapidly spreading wildfire threatened homes and tourist accommodations on the Croatian island of Brac, with firefighters battling the blaze overnight.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Vanuatu ferry capsize leaves one dead, 30 missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a884b9c6ff2d290bac41a88e495ed1f0eacefc3ba5e5524505055f94a907897c</id><updated>2026-09-14T05:08:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T10:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/vanuatu-ferry-capsize-leaves-one-dead-30-missing/a-79249954--620cbead1598.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/vanuatu-ferry-capsize-leaves-one-dead-30-missing/a-79249954?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Rescue efforts have been slow after a South Pacific inter-island ferry sank in bad weather on Friday. An investigation has already begun into negligence on the part of the operator.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Indonesia rescuers search for 130 people after ferry sinks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1306316244b9f22cdc4cb5a849be6016c207380f8edfbd08a607e93ef5107850</id><updated>2026-09-14T05:08:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T09:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/indonesia-rescuers-search-for-130-people-after-ferry-sinks/a